hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"25","[AI-translation] Hamein riwayat kiye Hannad bin al-Sari, kehne lage: Hamein khabar di 'Abd al-Rahman bin Abi al-Zinad ne, Hisham bin 'Urwah se, unke waalid se, Aishah se. Unhon ne kaha: Main aur Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ek hi bartan se ghusal karte the, aur unke baal jumme se zyada aur wafre se kam the."
"26","[AI-translation] Hamein riwayat kiye Ahmad bin Mani', kehne lage: Hamein riwayat kiye Abu Qatan, kehne lage: Hamein riwayat kiye Shu'bah, Abi Ishaq se, al-Bara' bin 'Azib se. Unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) marboo (miyaar qad) the, dono kandhon ke darmiyan doori thi, aur unki jumma unke kaanon ke naram hisson tak pohanchti thi."
"27","[AI-translation] Hamein riwayat kiye Muhammad bin Bashshar, kehne lage: Hamein riwayat kiye Wahb bin Jarir bin Hazim, kehne lage: Mere waalid ne mujhe riwayat ki, Qatadah se. Unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas se poocha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke baal kaisay thay? Unhon ne kaha: Na ghungriale the aur na bilkul seedhe, unke baal unke kaanon ke naram hisson tak pohanchte the."
"28","[AI-translation] Hamein riwayat kiye Muhammad bin Yahya bin Abi 'Umar al-Makki, kehne lage: Hamein riwayat kiye Sufyan bin 'Uyaynah ne, Ibn Abi Najih se, Mujahid se, Umm Hani' bint Abi Talib se. Unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) Makkah tashrif laye, aur unki chaar ladiyan (zulfen) theen."
"29","[AI-translation] Hamein riwayat kiye Suwayd bin Nasr, kehne lage: Hamein riwayat kiye 'Abd Allah bin al-Mubarak ne, Ma'mar se, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas se: Ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke baal unke kaanon ke aadhe hisson tak pohanchte the."
"30","[AI-translation] Hamein riwayat kiye Suwayd bin Nasr, hamein riwayat kiye 'Abd Allah bin al-Mubarak ne, Yunus bin Yazid se, al-Zuhri se. Kehne lage: Hamein riwayat kiye 'Ubayd Allah bin 'Abd Allah bin 'Utbah ne, Ibn 'Abbas se: Ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) apne baal aage ki taraf latakaye rakhte the, aur mushrik apne sar mein fareeq (maang) dalte the, aur ahl-e-kitab apne baal latakaye rakhte the, aur aap ahl-e-kitab ki muwafaqat pasand farmate the un baaton mein jin mein kisi cheez ka hukm nahi diya gaya tha, phir Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne apne sar mein fareeq (maang) dala."
"31","[AI-translation] Hamein riwayat kiye Muhammad bin Bashshar, kehne lage: Hamein riwayat kiye 'Abd al-Rahman bin Mahdi ne, Ibrahim bin Nafi' al-Makki se, Ibn Abi Najih se, Mujahid se, Umm Hani' se. Unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko chaar ladiyon (zulfon) wala dekha."
"32","[AI-translation] Hamein riwayat kiye Ishaq bin Musa al-Ansari, hamein riwayat kiye Ma'n bin 'Isa, hamein riwayat kiye Malik bin Anas ne, Hisham bin 'Urwah se, unke waalid se, Aishah se. Unhon ne kaha: Main Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke sar mein kanghi karti thi jabke main haiz ki halat mein hoti thi."
